# the effects grid: REC held shows it, the white keys play the effects while held; a tap on REC stays dub hold
listen
wait 3000
press REC
wait 400
said EFFECTS GRID
key w4 down
wait 300
said Low-pass
key w12 down
wait 1500
release REC
wait 300
key w4 up
key w12 up
wait 800
expect frozen 0
tap REC
wait 300
expect frozen 1
said HOLD ON
tap REC
wait 300
expect frozen 0
# every effect in turn, and all of them at once: no clipping
press REC
wait 300
key w0 down
key w1 down
key w2 down
key w3 down
wait 2000
key w5 down
key w6 down
key w7 down
key w8 down
key w9 down
key w10 down
key w11 down
wait 2000
key w13 down
key w14 down
key w15 down
wait 3000
release REC
key w0 up
key w1 up
key w2 up
key w3 up
key w5 up
key w6 up
key w7 up
key w8 up
key w9 up
key w10 up
key w11 up
key w13 up
key w14 up
key w15 up
wait 4000
expect frozen 0
expect playing 1
